# AI Code Provenance Protocol

All tracked source-code changes MUST use ai-prov MCP. Before editing, call
provenance.session_start. Before reporting completion, call
provenance.session_finish and require finished. If either call fails, stop,
report the error code, and do not claim success.

Workflow: confirm ai-prov init; start a session with task, agent cursor, and
model; edit; finish using the returned session ID; optionally call
provenance.verify for staged strict verification before commit.

Only provenance.session_start, provenance.session_finish, and
provenance.verify are valid tool names. Do not edit before start, skip finish,
submit client-generated diffs as facts, or manually commit between start and
finish. Unrecorded lines are never AI code.

For PROJECT_NOT_INITIALIZED run init. For SESSION_BASELINE_CONFLICT start a new
session. Retry STORAGE_LOCKED later.
